.TH NETRUNE 1 "" "Netrune 8.5.0b3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
netrune \- local-first network operations platform
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B netrune
[--profile NAME] DOMAIN ACTION [ARGUMENTS] [GLOBAL FLAGS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Netrune provides profile-isolated inventory, diagnostics, ingest, plugins, and bounded path inspection.
.SH DOMAINS
.TP
.B inventory
Switch/router inventory, flat-file migration, details, and bulk activity checks.
.TP
.B ap
Wireless AP inventory, AP-on-switch lookup, AP move history, unjoined WLC records, and AP timelines.
.TP
.B topology
LLDP/CDP neighbor scans, topology display, topology changes, and link timelines.
.TP
.B memory
Relationship memory: AP attachments, IP/MAC ownership, switch ports, topology, and source confidence.
.TP
.B health
Reachability, stale state, offline lists, attention queue, and health timeline.
.TP
.B backup
Online-only, changed-only config backups plus backup history and diffs.
.TP
.B device
SSH, read-only show commands, config previews/confirmed changes, and inventory enrichment.
.TP
.B vault
Local SSH-password vault lifecycle with terminal sudo authentication and no graphical pinentry.
.TP
.B vlan
Read-only VLAN lookup/propagation plus guarded VLAN changes.
.TP
.B lookup
Core and MAC lookups. Results are cached into relationship memory.
.TP
.B diagnose
Local/core latency, verified Internet speed, controlled throughput, port health, and guarded copper cable diagnostics.
.TP
.B workflow
Safe multi-step operator workflows.
.TP
.B commands
Canonical command registry used by the CLI, previews, and workflows.
.TP
.B db
SQLite lifecycle and flat-file compatibility shortcuts.
.TP
.B ask
Deterministic state retrieval and registry-backed command planning from natural language.
.TP
.B init
Initialize an isolated profile and check host capabilities.
.TP
.B profile
Create, select, inspect, and migrate isolated operator profiles.
.TP
.B config
Inspect and change non-secret profile configuration.
.TP
.B secrets
Manage named sudo-gated encrypted secrets without putting values in arguments or config.
.TP
.B ingest
Validate and run declarative, provenance-preserving data channels.
.TP
.B plugin
Discover and explicitly enable trusted Python entry-point plugins.
.TP
.B setup
Stand up a working install from the few facts that differ between two of them.
.TP
.B traffic
Interface and reachability monitoring. Collection is watchlist driven: only targets you name are ever polled.
.TP
.B path
Inspect a bounded endpoint path across cached topology and live read-only forwarding evidence.
.TP
.B excel
Correlate your own Excel workbooks with Netrune's inventory, and build tracker workbooks.
.TP
.B support
Create privacy-redacted diagnostics for support and bug reports.
